      "content": "The Traiana Harmony NetLink API provides netting, settlement orchestration, and trade compression services. NetLink enables counterparties to perform on-demand intraday netting of FX transactions, pre-settlement netting for equities, and trade compression between retail brokers and executing brokers to reduce settlement risk and optimize intraday liquidity.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Traiana (CME Group)",
